    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/777850/extras/860cc1f1f8c0ac43cbbf2ce296374d24.avif?t=1517851615\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About</h2>Cannon Crew is a co-op Castle Defence Party game!<br><br>Play with a team of 1-4 and work together to stop the enemy breaching your castle walls. Feel free to get competitive within your team - the more gold you can snatch or jobs you complete will give you a higher score than the others - but don't get too distracted from the incoming horde!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Modes</h2>- Story Mode<br><br><br>- Survival<br><br>- Puzzles<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Difficulty</h2>The difficulty changes depending on number of players in-game. If you're playing with a team of 4 then enemy waves will arrive quicker and be harder to defeat - Singleplayer means enemies will move slower and take less hits.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Planned Features</h2>- Online Co-Op<br><br>- Uploading Custom Levels to Steam Workshop",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/777850/extras/860cc1f1f8c0ac43cbbf2ce296374d24.avif?t=1517851615\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About</h2>Cannon Crew is a co-op Castle Defence Party game!<br><br>Play with a team of 1-4 and work together to stop the enemy breaching your castle walls. Feel free to get competitive within your team - the more gold you can snatch or jobs you complete will give you a higher score than the others - but don't get too distracted from the incoming horde!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Modes</h2>- Story Mode<br><br><br>- Survival<br><br>- Puzzles<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Difficulty</h2>The difficulty changes depending on number of players in-game. If you're playing with a team of 4 then enemy waves will arrive quicker and be harder to defeat - Singleplayer means enemies will move slower and take less hits.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Planned Features</h2>- Online Co-Op<br><br>- Uploading Custom Levels to Steam Workshop",
    "short_description": "Cannon Crew is a multiplayer co-op castle defence party game. Work as a team to defend your castle from incoming enemy attacks.",
